_content":"劾，戶槪翻。師古曰：傅，讀曰附。","note_content_jianti_auto":"劾，户槪翻。师古曰：傅，读曰附。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"92111c41-db0e-11ef-973f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孟康","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟康","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"92111c46-db0e-11ef-a702-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"92111c47-db0e-11ef-b479-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"汙，烏故翻。孟康曰：衊，音漫。師古曰：衊，音秣，謂塗染也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"污，乌故翻。孟康曰：蔑，音漫。师古曰：蔑，音秣，谓涂染也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":187,"tongjian_id":"92111c45-db0e-11ef-91bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲，于僞翻；下爲公同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为，于伪翻；下为公同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":210,"tongjian_id":"92111c48-db0e-11ef-ad75-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姑者，父之同產。長，知兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姑者，父之同产。长，知两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":237,"tongjian_id":"92111c49-db0e-11ef-bd78-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"妖，巧也，艷也，好也。妖，於驕翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"妖，巧也，艳也，好也。妖，于骄翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":258,"tongjian_id":"92111c4a-db0e-11ef-9f28-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92111c4c-db0e-11ef-90f3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：言其姑亦當自恥，必不與姦。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：言其姑亦当自耻，必不与奸。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":268,"tongjian_id":"92111c4b-db0e-11ef-813b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92111c4e-db0e-11ef-9639-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：本所問者，怨望朝廷之言也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：本所问者，怨望朝廷之言也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":277,"tongjian_id":"92111c4d-db0e-11ef-9292-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言何爲而自發內亂之事。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言何为而自发内乱之事。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":284,"tongjian_id":"92111c4f-db0e-11ef-b740-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"躡尋者，謂躡其失言之後，而尋其內亂之跡也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"蹑寻者，谓蹑其失言之后，而寻其内乱之迹也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":316,"tongjian_id":"92111c50-db0e-11ef-921a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"如淳","people_name_jianti_auto":"如淳","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92111c52-db0e-11ef-b1bc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"如淳曰：覆蓋之，則計之上。治，直之翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"如淳曰：覆盖之，则计之上。治，直之翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":329,"tongjian_id":"92111c51-db0e-11ef-b90b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"舉憲者，舉以法也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"举宪者，举以法也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":336,"tongjian_id":"92111c53-db0e-11ef-8176-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孔安國","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔安国","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"92111c55-db0e-11ef-85e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"馬","people_name_jianti_auto":"马","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"92111c56-db0e-11ef-878d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"上，與尚同。書·呂刑：皇帝清問下民。孔安國曰：清問，詳問也。馬曰：清，訊。","note_content_jianti_auto":"上，与尚同。书·吕刑：皇帝清问下民。孔安国曰：清问，详问也。马曰：清，讯。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":359,"tongjian_id":"92111c54-db0e-11ef-880c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"著，明也。效，驗也。明其事之不然，具有證驗也。失誤，謂誤入人罪爲失。","note_content_jianti_auto":"著，明也。效，验也。明其事之不然，具有证验也。失误，谓误入人罪为失。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":371,"tongjian_id":"92111c58-db0e-11ef-9ef8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[]